Included: the AIDL interfaces, the parcelables (OpenPgpError,
OpenPgpSignatureResult, OpenPgpDecryptionResult, OpenPgpMetadata,
AutocryptPeerUpdate), OpenPgpApi, OpenPgpUtils, ParcelFileDescriptorUtil and
OpenPgpServiceConnection. Package names and source files are unchanged; the
client UI widgets (OpenPgpAppPreference, OpenPgpKeyPreference) and the example
app were left out because a provider has no use for them. Only the Gradle
build script was rewritten.
